   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WVI Bulawayo WASH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Vision project has the objective of providing emergency     water and sanitation assistance to protect the health status of       residents living in the City of Bulawayo. The project is supported    with SEK 4,620,000 for the period December 2008 to April 2009. The    project is implemented as part of the UN Emergency Response Fund for  Zimbabwe and is partly supported by World Vision UK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">World Vision-projektet har som m&#xe5;l att ge akut vatten- och sanitetshj&#xe4;lp f&#xf6;r att skydda h&#xe4;lsotillst&#xe5;ndet f&#xf6;r inv&#xe5;nare som bor i staden Bulawayo. Projektet st&#xf6;ds med 4 620 000 kronor f&#xf6;r perioden december 2008 till april 2009. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs som en del av FN:s beredskapsfond f&#xf6;r Zimbabwe och st&#xf6;ds delvis av World Vision UK</narrative>
  </description>
